8714_1754756462167319207_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ipFLIyBNC_kQ7kNvwFxNdMF&_nc_oc=AdlJFQHEMSQyiW_BNttce76n-i4FC4o3axPNEztEiaaVtt8W3EcD8MdgA9qSzKaGrrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsiSsmmFXxgiJGIk8gU-NUlWP6INn2lC5IrulxUnmzevQ&oe=69A6BB9A"}, {"file_name": "SS (4).png", "id": "848701274188738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619078_848701280855404_6037464139818030185_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dxxAB-zOoVgQ7kNvwGin_NJ&_nc_oc=AdmH-sEvdcgugbkIuAAl-pEzWCoP0VDr-S94jf6LfW3HXHMB2a2pSornvxuHRlPTUjI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsSHyyvh9ueuUb79v6uLIJNjLxATHfEYAYKh-pB8ogXTw&oe=69A6CC9E"}, {"file_name": "SS (5).png", "id": "1210356320938573", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1210356324271906_696441178982742201_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CHrwa8f5pQEQ7kNvwHWXcsO&_nc_oc=Adkzp83FYC4cIlDUSlnQz44DxpQ88uPCUol2OjQ60-BLYpXWJ2QGMywxjyyBV8OOQKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftJZuhNDUv-H93lYaxWJAwxy8CrTF0tRHCd85KojtOZBQ&oe=69A6D115"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Camp Fire MR", "keywords": ["Campfire", "Hearth", "Zen", "Relaxation", "Meditation"], "long_description": "# BRING CALM TO YOUR REALITY\nIn a world of noise, find your quiet center. Campfire MR is a simple, free Early Access tool that uses the power of Mixed Reality (MR) to bring the warmth and tranquility of a campfire into your personal space.\n\n\n# YOUR PERSONAL MR SANCTUARY\nCampfire MR is not a game  or a complex guided meditation app. It is a focused utility  designed for one purpose: to create a \"soothing ambiance\"  that enhances your environment.   \n", "short_description": "Campfire MR is a simple, beautiful Mixed Reality tool that places a cozy campfire right in your living room, bedroom, or office. \nNo guides, no goals. Just pure, simple ambiance.\n"}]}, "developer_name"